ull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120346","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120346.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120346.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-16T17:51:54Z"},"body":"\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAs part of #116640, I updated the warning for `Label` to now suggest the user use a maximum width for the autowrapping `Label` to work correctly. However, since that PR has been merged, some issues/limitations were discovered with the way it works (#120167, #119325, and #119346).\r\n\r\nThis PR partially updates the warning to: \r\n* No longer show when a minimum size is configured. \r\n  * The intent was that the new system should supersede the old one (whilst keeping both functional). As the new system isn't fully reliable, I do not believe this is the correct approach at this moment.\r\n* Recommend setting a minimum size first, or a maximum width second\r\n  * This should hopefully lead to people trying the minimum size first, which is a proven system without limitations. However, we still let the user know they can use a maximum width. \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNone\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120346/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}